cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use CesarAlex in research, please cite this software and the associated
  research paper when appropriate.
title: >-
  CesarAlex: integration of Lattes curricula, ORCID, and OpenAlex for
  bibliometric coverage analysis
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Wellington Barbosa
    family-names: Rodrigues
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6465-6012
    affiliation: Universidade Federal do ABC and Universidade de São Paulo, Brazil
  - given-names: Thamyres Vieira dos
    family-names: Santos
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3644-8600
    affiliation: Universidade de São Paulo and Hospital Israelita Albert Einstein, Brazil
  - given-names: Rogério
    family-names: Mugnaini
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9334-3448
    affiliation: Universidade de São Paulo, Brazil
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-05
repository-code: https://github.com/wellbar2/CesarAlex
url: https://cesaralex-beta.streamlit.app/
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  CesarAlex integrates publication records from Brazilian Lattes curricula,
  ORCID profiles, and OpenAlex. It normalizes DOI identifiers, compares source
  coverage, supports conservative author-profile inference, and exports
  per-researcher and consolidated reports for bibliometric research.
keywords:
  - Lattes Platform
  - ORCID
  - OpenAlex
  - bibliometrics
  - scientometrics
  - persistent identifiers
